# containers — container/orchestration CLIs (FETCHED-ONLINE, never baked). The
# container ENGINES (docker, docker-compose, podman) stay BAKED in the dev
# baseline (packages/goodies.list); rootful docker is the default. This pack adds
# the orchestration + inspection TOOLING on top, fetched online on demand. Most
# members are official-repo; `kind` (Kubernetes-in-Docker) is AUR, so the engine
# presence-checks and bootstraps paru for it automatically.
#
# A `--rootless` flag (containers.d/post-add) optionally enables the user's
# rootless podman socket via the shared mutator (ledger-recorded, undone by
# containers.d/post-remove on `iictl pack remove`). Without the flag the pack is
# pure tooling with no system side effect.
#meta:type dev
lazydocker
ctop
dive
k9s
kubectl
helm
kind
